# --- Shared Prettier Ignore List ---
#
# Paths the formatter must not rewrite in a calling repository: build output,
# dependency trees, lockfiles, and machine-generated files, where formatting
# either means nothing or actively corrupts the artifact.
#
# ---

dist/
node_modules/
.git/
package-lock.json
coverage/
# Tool caches: git-ignored and machine-written, and a check run after the
# tests would otherwise read pytest's README and mypy's JSON as files to format.
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
# Jekyll/Liquid templates - Prettier's HTML/JSON formatters re-wrap
# Liquid tags; the site chrome is hand-formatted instead.
_layouts/
search.json
404.html
_site/

# Generated repository-traffic archive (machine-written data, not hand-formatted)
analytics/

# Generated badge and metric SVGs (machine-rendered, not hand-formatted)
assets/badges/
